      "value": "Thanks for feedback. Some adjustments were made today to center deadspace. We also took out click to stop because that breaks the games. I physically can't stop pressing on the pad when pulling the trigger. Will be out tomorrow with P15 and people can try again.",
      "viewerReactions": null
