      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{58c6d558ff44e44ada717902|full_name}: super, thanks for the update.  a big part of it was just learning that releasing meant removing all micro contact with the pad, when in the past for me that meant letting go of the hard click.  after learning this the movement wasn't totally perfect yet but much improved.  takes some practice.",
